      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Issue Type: <b>Bug</b>\r\n\r\nCurrently we our built-in markdown renderer is called `markdownItRenderer`\r\n\r\nThis was fine for internal use, but now that renderers are being exposed publically, this becomes api. I propose we change it to:\r\n\r\n```\r\nvscode.markdown-it-renderer\r\n```\r\n\r\nVS Code version: Code - Insiders 1.69.0-insider (Universal) (f1abeeab7e51df997bbb0f1ff900321ad2f21ac0, 2022-06-30T05:17:23.222Z)\r\nOS version: Darwin x64 21.5.0\r\nRestricted Mode: No\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>System Info</summary>\r\n\r\n|Item|Value|\r\n|---|---|\r\n|CPUs|Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-9980HK CPU @ 2.40GHz (16 x 2400)|\r\n|GPU Status|2d_canvas: enabled<br>canvas_oop_rasterization: disabled_off<br>direct_rendering_display_compositor: disabled_off_ok<br>gpu_compositing: enabled<br>metal: disabled_off<br>multiple_raster_threads: enabled_on<br>opengl: enabled_on<br>rasterization: enabled<br>raw_draw: disabled_off_ok<br>skia_renderer: enabled_on<br>video_decode: enabled<br>video_encode: enabled<br>webgl: enabled<br>webgl2: enabled|\r\n|Load (avg)|4, 3, 3|\r\n|Memory (System)|32.00GB (0.02GB free)|\r\n|Process Argv|--crash-reporter-id 48781ca2-1705-4f64-9bab-325055aab55d|\r\n|Screen Reader|no|\r\n|VM|0%|\r\n</details>\r\n<!-- generated by issue reporter -->",
